// Everglade's content tables of the release before (#13408): the bytes of
// everglade/content/everglade.previous.content, written by
//   coax/web/tool.sh everglade/model/tools/content-check.coax everglade/content/everglade.content --carry
// Never edit it by hand. A room is built with it, and a seat whose page is still the release before's
// plays by these tables (docs/protocol/everglade-previous-pins.md). coax/web/tool.sh everglade-parity
// fails when the two differ.
EC_PREVIOUS :: "aethyr.content.v1 everglade 1\nreach 100000\ntable ability id name:text\ntable creature id name:text kind:int xp:int\n1|Wolf|0|50\n2|Goblin Warrior|1|50\ntable dialogue id npc:text point:ref.point quest:opt.quest line:text\n1|Warden|1|1|The wolves grow bold on the south road. Thin the pack and bring me their pelts.\n2|Warden|1|2|Goblins have made a camp past the far woods. Find it and drive them off.\ntable item id name:text slot:int\n1|Wolf pelt|0\n2|Goblin ear|0\n3|Warden's cloak|2\n4|Traveller's ring|7\ntable loot id creature:ref.creature item:opt.item weight:int\nsum weight by creature 100\n1|1|1|60\n2|1|0|40\n3|2|2|50\n4|2|0|50\ntable point id name:text x:cm z:cm r:int\n1|Glade|0|0|6000\n2|Wolf woods|0|-17500|6000\n3|Goblin camp|0|-45000|8000\ntable quest id name:text\n1|Thin the pack\n2|The goblin camp\ntable reward id quest:ref.quest item:opt.item coin:int xp:int\n1|1|3|25|100\n2|2|4|50|150\ntable spawn id creature:ref.creature point:ref.point count:int\n1|1|2|8\n2|2|3|4\ntable step id quest:ref.quest creature:opt.creature point:opt.point item:opt.item talk:opt.dialogue count:int\n1|1|1|0|0|0|4\n2|1|0|0|1|0|2\n3|1|0|0|0|1|1\n4|2|0|3|0|0|1\n5|2|2|0|0|0|2\n6|2|0|0|0|2|1\n";
